        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Polished Chrome Keyed Lock for Sliding Doors or Pocket Doors</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Baldwin this polished chrome sliding pocket door lock is a single cylinder lock, meaning a key operated the lock from the outside while a thumb turn operates the lock from the interior.  Built to last, all the component parts are made primarily of solid forge brass, accurately machined for a lifetime of smooth operation. Built in flush edge pull provides convenient in pocket door applications.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDesigned with heavy gauge steel case for maximum strength. For use with a 1-3/8\" thick door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith every detail, Baldwin hardware sends a message of quality and style\u0014 throughout the life of your door. For an investment in your home that will last for many years to come.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> A key operates the lock from the exterior; while a thumbturn unlocks the lock from the interior.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img  src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/baldwin-pocket-lock.gif?v=1704354769\" border=\"0\" width=\"590\" height=\"300\" alt=\"Baldwin Pocket Door Locks\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Baldwin Sliding or Pocket Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Latch Case Height: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Case Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Edge Face Height: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Edge Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: 1/2\" x 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Projection: .937\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lock Cylinder: Schlage \"C\" Keyway</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: <b>1-3/8\" Thick Door</b></li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Polished Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/8590.pdf?v=1691094970\" target=\"new\"><b>Baldwin 8590 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>This has been Discontinued by the Manufacturer.</b> Please see <a href=\"/collections/baldwin-sliding-door-hardware\">for Baldwin Sliding Pocket Door Hardware</a>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<b>** Clearance Priced,  limited quantities available. \r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>Only One Left</b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p> -->",
